change = "Remove the orphan share OwnershipTransferred decoder while retaining the exact event-count and name checks; leave ownership decoders on the spot rails intact."
proof = "TestRepairM_829_SharePointerTable constructs the real registry, encodes and decodes every deployed share event after ShareTokenCreated, checks typed row values and accounts, and requires a historical ownership event to retain its topics/data as unknown raw output; the existing decoder ownership case asserts the same deployed-ABI behavior."
